{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "來", "id": "來"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "畔", "id": "畔"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.0101568681062463, "source": "公", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.7588424398253403, "source": "公", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.0397762852874046, "source": "公", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.9560670171615597, "source": "公", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.0842648402599682, "source": "公", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.569772656041669, "source": "公", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 1.1643075479335045, "source": "公", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.1643075479335045, "source": "公", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 1.569772656041669, "source": "公", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 1.2020478759163515, "source": "畔", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.9752377641498333, "source": "畔", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.7033040486661917, "source": "臣", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.1643075479335045, "source": "臣", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 3.543853682063679, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0928485839513595, "source": "智", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.588342237036242, "source": "來", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.785995764511305, "source": "來", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.895195056476297, "source": "知", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 3.543853682063679, "source": "義",